  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sheia butter phase 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shea (Vitellaria paradoxa ssp. Nilotica) is a natural ingredient traditionally collected by women. The fruit can be processed into shea butter. That is an important ingredient for cosmetics and in high demand on the world market. By including a small industrial processor, female entrepreneurs with a good track record can test whether or not they can meet the requirements, the continuous supply of a steady quality, of potential customers that have shown serious interest in the product. The major challenge is to arrange transport through various conflict affected areas in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
